  "body": [
    "We've been so impressed and excited to see people like you join the Fairtrade movement. Activists just like you are hosting events, creating groups, posting on social media, contacting your representatives or simply telling their friends and family. We appreciate your work, and we want to support your efforts. You can find several resources below.",
    "Sign up below for petitions, campaigns, call ins, events, stunts and spectacles to change the world."
  ],
